trajectory.patch:
An issue in `tests/drivers/reset/mmio/boards/qemu_cortex_m3.overlay` causes the `reset0` devicetree node to lack its `compatible = "reset-mmio";` property, preventing the MMIO reset controller driver instance from being instantiated for `reset0`.

Adding `compatible = "reset-mmio";` to `reset0` resolves the missing device reference.

tests/drivers/reset/mmio/boards/qemu_cortex_m3.overlay
<<<<<<<< SEARCH
	reset0: reset@20000004 {
		reg = <0x20000004 0x4>;
		num-resets = <16>;
	};
========
	reset0: reset@20000004 {
		compatible = "reset-mmio";
		reg = <0x20000004 0x4>;
		num-resets = <16>;
	};
